2882e7/uploads/origins/5a0d5e91-a74e-4b8f-b01c-b91e57509656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=276f42082465ffc6dea53b91882357b8, https://si.imgix.net/c92882e7/uploads/origins/5a0d5e91-a74e-4b8f-b01c-b91e57509656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ee06eead330ff774cb738ca334be55d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c92882e7/uploads/origins/5a0d5e91-a74e-4b8f-b01c-b91e57509656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58a2df35c23b5c4bb71f2cfa9aafbc07 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi hii~! I LOVE your art and would be so happy if you drew my vtuber OC! She is a sleepy and curious ghost child.  \n\nI would like panels for my twitch. \n1. OC doodling the mascot in a sketchbook with a red crayon\n2. OC reading sternly from a paper to a mascot\n3. a pile of gifts with OC head sticking out\n4. 3 mascots in a group, talking and gossiping (no mouths)\n5. OC sleeping on a soft pillow, dreaming and peaceful\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1gbcDG6mH1Xpe6-hgGXMThLK-0slLnKgF", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@___p___o___/works/456", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9aa8cdc1/uploads/origins/fb0caa40-f244-4676-a68e-1b0cf52b1ea7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe509e3453687435183bb2fce3fa0230", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9aa8cdc1/uploads/origins/fb0caa40-f244-4676-a68e-1b0cf52b1ea7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe509e3453687435183bb2fce3fa0230, https://si.imgix.net/9aa8cdc1/uploads/origins/fb0caa40-f244-4676-a68e-1b0cf52b1ea7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8241d45571d57b68245612f920e07f95 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9aa8cdc1/uploads/origins/fb0caa40-f244-4676-a68e-1b0cf52b1ea7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e041b1d9ff7b0aee2af85d2f6a7b9d5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ヤンデレをテーマに好きなように描いてください！16:9の比率で背景を透明にしたバージョンもぜひお願いします。）\n\ndrive.google.com/drive/folders/15CktWBV6q7DtYKBYWJVM2d41tuI22olj?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@___p___o___/works/455", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/545f2f6d/uploads/origins/2a3802b0-1ca0-46a7-b988-ec0e5cfda925?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5fbf54fe10c94a3fb5e050441404b4b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/545f2f6d/uploads/origins/2a3802b0-1ca0-46a7-b988-ec0e5cfda925?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5fbf54fe10c94a3fb5e050441404b4b, https://si.imgix.net/545f2f6d/uploads/origins/2a3802b0-1ca0-46a7-b988-ec0e5cfda925?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed57ead1314eeb08c377ecf9d4ba5033 2x, https://si.imgix.net/545f2f6d/uploads/origins/2a3802b0-1ca0-46a7-b988-ec0e5cfda925?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=529cb2ac23504a5e04f94ccc8362d808 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のVtuberを描いてくれませんか？彼女はバッタとコオロギをイメージしています。  私のOCは不器用でかわいい昆虫の女の子です。おバカでハッピー。お酒が好きで、すぐ赤面します。虫が大好き。  \n\nTwitchやTwitterで使えるバナーが欲しいです。https://skeb.jp/@___p____o___/works/374。\n必要に応じて価格を調整してください。\n\n参考：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1K_7L0E2JzFid9jIOYJEdaFOFi4z2m_-K?Usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@___p___o___/works/454", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7cf8bb6d/uploads/origins/7bba8c89-11ea-4541-b651-6751936dbe0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a18cad82d14a43d99f00fecfdfeb65d7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7cf8bb6d/uploads/origins/7bba8c89-11ea-4541-b651-6751936dbe0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a18cad82d14a43d99f00fecfdfeb65d7, https://si.imgix.net/7cf8bb6d/uploads/origins/7bba8c89-11ea-4541-b651-6751936dbe0a?bg=%23fff&